{"sha": "36e5977529dfb8dcc4d4f5ac5ffeba4495e3c148f07e94446a58edf5d4aa9980", "body": ["\\section*{Chapter \\ref{ch:g9:trig} --- Trigonometry in the Right Triangle}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:trig:1}", "斜边：$\\sqrt{9^2 + 12^2} = \\sqrt{81 + 144} = \\sqrt{225} = 15$。", "", "另一直角边：$\\sqrt{17^2 - 8^2} = \\sqrt{289 - 64} = \\sqrt{225} = 15$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:trig:2}", "$7^2 + 24^2 = 49 + 576 = 625 = 25^2$：是直角三角形（勾股定理的逆定理，", "直角所对的边为 $25$）。", "", "$5^2 + 6^2 = 61 \\neq 64 = 8^2$：不是直角三角形。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:trig:3}", "斜边为 $[EF]$（与 $D$ 处的直角相对）。", "与 $\\theta = \\widehat E$ 相对的边为 $[DF]$；邻边为", "$[DE]$。由此可得", "\\[", "\\cos\\theta = \\frac{DE}{EF}, \\qquad", "\\sin\\theta = \\frac{DF}{EF}, \\qquad", "\\tan\\theta = \\frac{DF}{DE}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:trig:4}", "对边：$10 \\sin 28^\\circ \\approx 10 \\times 0.469 = 4.7$。", "邻边：$10 \\cos 28^\\circ \\approx 10 \\times 0.883 = 8.8$。", "（验算：$4.7^2 + 8.8^2 \\approx 22 + 77 \\approx 100$。）", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:trig:5}", "$\\tan\\theta = \\dfrac{4.5}{6} = 0.75$，于是", "$\\theta = \\tan^{-1}(0.75) \\approx 37^\\circ$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:trig:6}", "在由观察者、地面上位于无人机正下方的点与无人机", "构成的直角三角形中，高度 $120$ m 为仰角所对的边，", "水平距离 $d$ 为邻边。", "于是", "\\[", "\\tan 32^\\circ = \\frac{120}{d},", "\\qquad", "d = \\frac{120}{\\tan 32^\\circ} \\approx \\frac{120}{0.625} = 192 \\text{ m}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:trig:7}", "升高（$1.2$ m）为角所对的边，坡道长 $L$ 为", "斜边：", "\\[", "\\sin 5^\\circ = \\frac{1.2}{L},", "\\qquad", "L = \\frac{1.2}{\\sin 5^\\circ} \\approx \\frac{1.2}{0.0872} \\approx 13.8", "\\text{ m}.", "\\]", "坡道长度至少为 $13.8$ m。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:trig:8}", "由 $\\cos^2\\theta + \\sin^2\\theta = 1$ 得：", "$\\sin^2\\theta = 1 - 0.36 = 0.64$，且锐角的 $\\sin\\theta > 0$，", "故 $\\sin\\theta = 0.8$。于是", "$\\tan\\theta = \\dfrac{\\sin\\theta}{\\cos\\theta} = \\dfrac{0.8}{0.6} =", "\\dfrac43$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g9:trig:9}", "\\emph{等腰直角三角形}，两直角边为 $1$，斜边为", "$\\sqrt{1 + 1} = \\sqrt2$；每个锐角为 $45^\\circ$，且", "\\[", "\\cos 45^\\circ = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt2} = \\frac{\\sqrt2}{2} = \\sin 45^\\circ,", "\\qquad", "\\tan 45^\\circ = \\frac11 = 1 .", "\\]", "", "\\emph{等边三角形}，边长为 $1$，其高将它分成两个", "直角三角形，斜边为 $1$，底为 $\\frac12$，高为", "$h = \\sqrt{1 - \\frac14} = \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}$（勾股定理）。其中各角为", "$60^\\circ$（底边处）与 $30^\\circ$（顶点处）。由此读出", "各比值：", "\\[", "\\cos 60^\\circ = \\frac{1/2}{1} = \\frac12, \\quad", "\\sin 60^\\circ = \\frac{\\sqrt3/2}{1} = \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}, \\quad", "\\cos 30^\\circ = \\frac{\\sqrt3}{2}, \\quad", "\\sin 30^\\circ = \\frac12 .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g9:trig:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 视线以上的高度是", "$35^\\circ$ 所对的边，邻边为 $60$ m：", "$h = 60 \\tan 35^\\circ \\approx 60 \\times 0.700 = 42$ m。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 由 $\\tan\\theta = 0.12$ 得", "$\\theta = \\tan^{-1}(0.12) \\approx 6.8^\\circ$ --- 对道路来说算陡，", "但角度并不大。一条 $45^\\circ$ 的道路", "满足 $\\tan 45^\\circ = 1$，即坡度为 $100\\,\\%$。（“", "百分之一百”远非竖直——这是", "一个与滑雪缆车相关的常见误解。）", "", "\\textbf{3.} 在两锐角分别为 $\\theta$ 与", "$90^\\circ - \\theta$ 的直角三角形中，一锐角的对边", "恰是另一锐角的邻边，斜边则为公共边。于是", "$\\sin(90^\\circ - \\theta) = \\frac{\\text{其对边}}{h} =", "\\frac{\\text{邻边 }\\theta}{h} = \\cos\\theta$，且", "同理，$\\cos(90^\\circ - \\theta) = \\sin\\theta$：", "\\emph{余}弦是\\emph{余}角的正弦。", ""]}